    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Are you ready for a real truck parking challenge? We have strived to provide you with an exciting truck parking experience in one of the best truck parking games. Take control of the trucks and put your skills to the test as you maneuver these trailer vehicles through tight spaces and challenging obstacles.<br><br>In this game, you will step into the shoes of a skilled truck driver tasked with parking trailers in designated spots in different environments. Master the controls of the truck as you navigate through different levels, each presenting unique challenges and tasks to complete.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/865c10929357f2601cbeb07728c0f096.poster.avif?t=1750271326\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/865c10929357f2601cbeb07728c0f096.webm?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/865c10929357f2601cbeb07728c0f096.mp4?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In addition to levels, you will be able to deliver goods from one part to another across the virtual map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/76bda4e7768a93af2189a4e9748b7031.poster.avif?t=1750271326\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/76bda4e7768a93af2189a4e9748b7031.webm?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/76bda4e7768a93af2189a4e9748b7031.mp4?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Money earned from deliveries and parking is used to expand your fleet of new trucks and trailers, each with unique features, offering a variety of options to enhance your gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/19d31c6b7d00db07ced10d2f344d0507.poster.avif?t=1750271326\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/19d31c6b7d00db07ced10d2f344d0507.webm?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/19d31c6b7d00db07ced10d2f344d0507.mp4?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With realistic graphics and responsive controls, our truck parking simulator offers an authentic gaming experience that will keep you engaged for hours. Whether you are an experienced truck driver or new to the world of heavy vehicles, this game is bound to give you endless fun and excitement.<br><br>So are you up for the challenge? Get ready to show off your truck driving skills and become the ultimate trailer parking master in this thrilling truck parking game!",
    "about_the_game": "Are you ready for a real truck parking challenge? We have strived to provide you with an exciting truck parking experience in one of the best truck parking games. Take control of the trucks and put your skills to the test as you maneuver these trailer vehicles through tight spaces and challenging obstacles.<br><br>In this game, you will step into the shoes of a skilled truck driver tasked with parking trailers in designated spots in different environments. Master the controls of the truck as you navigate through different levels, each presenting unique challenges and tasks to complete.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/865c10929357f2601cbeb07728c0f096.poster.avif?t=1750271326\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/865c10929357f2601cbeb07728c0f096.webm?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/865c10929357f2601cbeb07728c0f096.mp4?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In addition to levels, you will be able to deliver goods from one part to another across the virtual map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/76bda4e7768a93af2189a4e9748b7031.poster.avif?t=1750271326\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/76bda4e7768a93af2189a4e9748b7031.webm?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/76bda4e7768a93af2189a4e9748b7031.mp4?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Money earned from deliveries and parking is used to expand your fleet of new trucks and trailers, each with unique features, offering a variety of options to enhance your gaming experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/19d31c6b7d00db07ced10d2f344d0507.poster.avif?t=1750271326\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/19d31c6b7d00db07ced10d2f344d0507.webm?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975900/extras/19d31c6b7d00db07ced10d2f344d0507.mp4?t=1750271326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With realistic graphics and responsive controls, our truck parking simulator offers an authentic gaming experience that will keep you engaged for hours. Whether you are an experienced truck driver or new to the world of heavy vehicles, this game is bound to give you endless fun and excitement.<br><br>So are you up for the challenge? Get ready to show off your truck driving skills and become the ultimate trailer parking master in this thrilling truck parking game!",
    "short_description": "Truck Parking Simulator VR is a fully interactive, realistic and immersive parking experience. But also an open world where you can deliver goods by truck. The game has one of the best truck physics simulations in VR.",
